  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 303.89,
      "e": 310.13,
      "text": "Most of these people, they're here just to follow up to check up on their health conditions."
    },
    {
      "s": 310.13,
      "e": 315.69,
      "text": "And then some of those people where most of their houses were seriously damaged."
    },
    {
      "s": 315.69,
      "e": 320.13,
      "text": "Especially those people who are reciting in the Malai."
    },
    {
      "s": 320.13,
      "e": 323.49,
      "text": "So Malai is the leader side of our village."
    },
    {
      "s": 323.49,
      "e": 331.29,
      "text": "And I believe that made you a reason why most of these people that are presently right now here"
    },
    {
      "s": 331.29,
      "e": 339.04,
      "text": "because of the need to follow up on their status of their health conditions."
    },
    {
      "s": 339.04,
      "e": 346.4,
      "text": "Well actually this was happened early in the morning around seven."
    },
    {
      "s": 346.4,
      "e": 349.08,
      "text": "It's like five minutes after seven."
    },
    {
      "s": 349.08,
      "e": 354.88,
      "text": "And I remember when I looked at the oceans, there was something wrong with the tide."
    },
    {
      "s": 354.88,
      "e": 363.75,
      "text": "It seems like the way we're all going is to sort of like a hole."
    },
    {
      "s": 363.75,
      "e": 368.79,
      "text": "And then actually didn't see the whole scene because I just took my mom and went in the car"
    },
    {
      "s": 368.79,
      "e": 373.09,
      "text": "and then we washed up on the mountain."
    },
    {
      "s": 373.09,
      "e": 379.29,
      "text": "Yeah, this is sort of like people are working together to provide service for those who really need the service."
    },
    {
      "s": 379.29,
      "e": 389.97,
      "text": "And especially right during the next day, there was the rec pass who came here to disseminate foods for other people."
    },
    {
      "s": 389.97,
      "e": 399.61,
      "text": "So I think most of their service, I just want to appreciate all of their service which will help all people from our village."
    }
  ],
